<title>POLAND: Centrostal trade suspended on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Centrostal trade suspended on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish steel products maker Centrostal SA was suspended from bourse trade on Tuesday because its July earnings report was sent on Monday after the 1600 GMT deadline, a bourse representative told Reuters.</p>
<p>On Monday the parallel market firm reported that its July net profit had risen to 0.25 million zlotys from 0.19 million in July a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
